      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "I'M TOO MESSY (5) turned in a modest effort most recently when fifth at Healesville over 300m behind Magic Western (17.09) in a Grade 5. Key runner on her best form. HARD COMPASS (1) broke a string of placings finishing in the money two on end before a last start sixth (24.71) at Bendigo. Solid record at the distance winning five races. Worth following up. BLACK XENA (2) ran the fastest on the card last time scoring by 3 lengths (22.19) at Ballarat. Looks suited and has winning claims again. GOOD ODDS ROCKY (8) has definite claims at his first try at this circuit.",
